[02:07:52.740] CORE EXPERIMENT - C objects -> virtual addresses (README 九)
[02:07:52.740] ======================================================================
[02:07:52.740] PIE + ASLR randomize ABSOLUTE addresses, but the relative layout
[02:07:52.740] (text/rodata/data/bss < heap < mmap < stack) is preserved.
